                                        "entry_id": "0e4d18a9-d9aa-31d8-9442-a31c588bca56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A music genre with layered soundscapes, dub and hip-hop influences (including the use of samples), and a progressive approach to beat programming."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d29d4e75-cd3e-4672-bf5b-65ce5ed99189",
                                                "sense_id": "ddc43ad7-9f66-3639-a5a2-5858eef917ba",
                                                "text": "This describes the sound of what is known as illbient, a genre of electronic music that arose in New York in the mid-1990s. The first illbient compilations were released by the Asphodel label—Crooklyn Dub Consortium Vol. 1 in 1995 and Incursions in Illbient in 1996—and Olive was involved with both projects."
                                            }
